{"created": "2026-10-28T15:36:21.267649+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-28T15:36:21.530246+00:00", "id": 23568911, "conceptrecid": "23568910", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23568910", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "metadata": {"title": "Replication Package for \"Uncentered Bootstrap t-Statistics Explain the Missing Time Series Momentum in Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020)\"", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "publication_date": "2026-10-28", "description": "<p>Replication package for Laura Capera Romero and Aleksi Pitk&auml;j&auml;rvi, \"Uncentered Bootstrap <em>t</em>-Statistics Explain the Missing Time Series Momentum in Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020)\", Critical Finance Review (forthcoming).</p>\n<p>The package contains the MATLAB code that produces every table and figure in the paper and its Internet Appendix, together with the output of a full run (bootstrap draws, tables and figures). It includes the parts of the code of Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020) that the analysis uses, some of them modified as documented in the README.</p>\n<p>The data are not included. The only input is Return.mat from the replication package of Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020), \"Time series momentum: Is it there?\", Journal of Financial Economics 135(3), 774-794, available from Guofu Zhou's website (https://guofuzhou.github.io/Data_and_Matlab_code.zip). README.txt explains how to combine the two downloads and gives SHA-256 checksums; the code verifies the data file before running.</p>\n<p>Requirements: MATLAB R2021a or newer with the Statistics and Machine Learning Toolbox and the Parallel Computing Toolbox.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Capera Romero, Laura", "affiliation": "Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam", "orcid": "0000-0001-5324-4146"}, {"name": "Pitk\u00e4j\u00e4rvi, Aleksi", "affiliation": "Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam", "orcid": "0009-0002-5598-7685"}], "keywords": ["time series momentum", "time series predictability", "bootstrapping", "pooled panel regression"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1016/j.jfineco.2019.08.004", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://guofuzhou.github.io/Data_and_Matlab_code.zip", "relation": "requires", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "matlab", "title": {"en": "MATLAB"}}]}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23568910"}}]}}, "title": "Replication Package for \"Uncentered Bootstrap t-Statistics Explain the Missing Time Series Momentum in Huang, Li, Wang, and Zhou (2020)\"", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568911", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23568911", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23568911?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23568911", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568911/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568910", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23568910", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23568910", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23568910", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23568911/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23568911/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568911/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568911/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568911/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23568911/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23568911/versions", "draf